    "generalSourceUrl": "https://law.justia.com/codes/oklahoma/title-26/section-26-1-101/",
    "generalSnippet": "On the first Tuesday succeeding the first Monday of November, 1976, and every four (4) years thereafter, a General Election shall be held... On said date, and every two (2) years thereafter, United States Senators and United States Representatives, whose terms expire before the next succeeding General Election, and state, district and county officers, whose terms expire before the next succeeding General Election, shall be elected."
